{"author":{"id":"694fb8161bd8bf91df2a28db7c649e48f8c5fa47ad3ad0234607d35f0482801a"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1789210690,"nonce":"jXPXFy4U7Vf+ldOvkFu18ggyptA=","title":"Tiered static method returns null once tier-up installs (stack-map safepoint miss)","message":"A static method that allocates an object late in its body and returns it returns null instead of the allocated value once the caller crosses jit_threshold (100 in src/runtime/engine.rs). Surfaced in @hatch:gltf scene loading (2026-06-03).\n\nGltfScene.buildNodes_ loops `out.add(GltfScene.buildNode_(n))` over 141 nodes. buildNode_ ends with `var node = GltfNode.new_(...); if (...) node.skinIndex = ...; return node` and has no null-returning path. Instrumented: all 141 calls entered; the last 17-41 (varies per run) returned null. The tail starts at the moment the tier-up'd version installs.\n\nBisect over 20-30 runs:\n- WLIFT_MODE=interpreter: 10/10 pass\n- default tiered: ~8/20\n- WLIFT_DISABLE_METHOD_OSR=1: ~8/20 (no effect)\n- WLIFT_DISABLE_JIT_INLINE=1: 0/20 (worse; inliner masks it)\n- WLIFT_DISABLE_STACK_MAPS=1: 30/30 (complete kill switch)\n\nKill switch points at GC stack-map plumbing. When the active safepoint lookup misses, scan_native_stack_roots (src/runtime/vm.rs, ~3217-3228) `continue`s past the frame without scanning any of its live roots. The freshly allocated GltfNode is unvisited; a GC fired inside a later call forwards it, the caller's register keeps the pre-forwarding pointer, Return reads stale bits and the caller sees null.\n\nTwo things to verify:\n1. Code-offset agreement: SafepointMetadata.code_offset (from cranelift user_stack_maps(), src/codegen/cranelift_backend.rs ~1340-1368) vs the walker's `ret_addr - code_range.start`. Cranelift may record the call instruction offset rather than the return-address offset; a mismatch silently drops every safepoint in that frame.\n2. Whether user_stack_maps() emits a safepoint for the allocating call at all.\n\nInline the per-item body into the loop (no per-item method call, no method tier-up). Applied to GltfScene.buildNodes_ in hatch-gltf. Sibling hot helpers at risk on denser assets: buildMaterials_/imageIndexOf_, extractPrimitive_, buildSkins_/readMat4Accessor_, readVec3Accessor_.","files":null}]}